{"ts": 0.258812, "dir": "out", "enc": "utf8", "data": "\u001b[90m──\u001b[0m \u001b[90mModule · env\u001b[0m \u001b[90m────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\u001b[0m \u001b[93mtask\u001b[0m \u001b[90m──\u001b[0m\r\n", "len": 248}
{"ts": 0.258856, "dir": "out", "enc": "utf8", "data": "\r\n", "len": 2}
{"ts": 0.261812, "dir": "out", "enc": "utf8", "data": "\u001b[1;97menv — task\u001b[0m\r\n\r\nProve that a child program can see a variable you exported. You will\r\nwork inside \u001b[94m/var/folders/jx/f_4n055973x5cwnyh_mhlw9h0000gn/T/shelltutor-sim-home-2_yrg4s4/env\u001b[0m.\r\n\r\n", "len": 204}
{"ts": 0.261859, "dir": "out", "enc": "utf8", "data": "  1. set \u001b[92mTOPIC\u001b[0m to the word \u001b[36mshell\u001b[0m\r\n  2. export it\r\n  3. run a child \u001b[92mbash -c\u001b[0m that prints \u001b[92m$TOPIC\u001b[0m into \u001b[94mseen.txt\u001b[0m\r\n     \u001b[90m(hint: single quotes, so the child replaces the variable)\u001b[0m\r\n\r\n\u001b[90mI will check: seen.txt holds the word shell, and your history shows\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[90mTOPIC set, exported, and read inside single quotes by a child.\u001b[0m\r\n\r\n\u001b[93m▶ Type \u001b[92mcheck\u001b[93m when done.\u001b[0m\r\n\r\n", "len": 430}
{"ts": 0.264549, "dir": "out", "enc": "utf8", "data": "\u001b[1;90mcheck\u001b[0m \u001b[90m(test your work)\u001b[0m   \u001b[1;90mshow\u001b[0m \u001b[90m(the task again)\u001b[0m   \u001b[1;90mquit\u001b[0m \u001b[90m(save and leave)\u001b[0m\r\n", "len": 132}
{"ts": 0.26483, "dir": "out", "enc": "utf8", "data": "\u001b[90m────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\u001b[0m\r\n\r\n", "len": 253}
{"ts": 0.278918, "dir": "out", "enc": "utf8", "data": "\u001b[?2004hshelltutor> ", "len": 20}
{"ts": 0.279087, "dir": "in", "enc": "utf8", "data": "TOPIC=shell\n", "len": 12}
{"ts": 0.279129, "dir": "out", "enc": "utf8", "data": "TOPIC=shell\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r", "len": 22}
{"ts": 0.279276, "dir": "out", "enc": "utf8", "data": "\u001b[?2004h", "len": 8}
{"ts": 0.279291, "dir": "out", "enc": "utf8", "data": "shelltutor> ", "len": 12}
{"ts": 0.279316, "dir": "in", "enc": "utf8", "data": "export TOPIC\n", "len": 13}
{"ts": 0.279376, "dir": "out", "enc": "utf8", "data": "export TOPIC\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r", "len": 23}
{"ts": 0.279475, "dir": "out", "enc": "utf8", "data": "\u001b[?2004hshelltutor> ", "len": 20}
{"ts": 0.279512, "dir": "in", "enc": "utf8", "data": "bash -c 'echo $TOPIC' > seen.txt\n", "len": 33}
{"ts": 0.279567, "dir": "out", "enc": "utf8", "data": "bash -c 'echo $TOPIC' > seen.txt\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r", "len": 43}
{"ts": 0.286446, "dir": "out", "enc": "utf8", "data": "\u001b[?2004hshelltutor> ", "len": 20}
{"ts": 0.286484, "dir": "in", "enc": "utf8", "data": "check\n", "len": 6}
{"ts": 0.286506, "dir": "out", "enc": "utf8", "data": "check\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r", "len": 16}
{"ts": 0.31063, "dir": "out", "enc": "utf8", "data": "\u001b[3J\u001b[H\u001b[2J", "len": 11}
{"ts": 0.311936, "dir": "out", "enc": "utf8", "data": "\u001b[90m──\u001b[0m \u001b[93mshelltutor\u001b[0m \u001b[90m──\u001b[0m \u001b[90mModule · env\u001b[0m \u001b[90m───────────────────────────────────────────────\u001b[0m \u001b[90m──\u001b[0m\r\n", "len": 243}
{"ts": 0.311992, "dir": "out", "enc": "utf8", "data": "\r\n", "len": 2}
{"ts": 0.314696, "dir": "out", "enc": "utf8", "data": "\u001b[1;97menv cleared.\u001b[0m\r\n\r\nCommands and keys from this module:\r\n  \u001b[92mname=value    \u001b[0m \u001b[90mset a variable in this shell\u001b[0m\r\n  \u001b[92mexport name   \u001b[0m \u001b[90mlet child programs see it\u001b[0m\r\n  \u001b[92mecho \"$PATH\"  \u001b[0m \u001b[90mthe folders searched for programs\u001b[0m\r\n  \u001b[92menv           \u001b[0m \u001b[90mlist what children receive\u001b[0m\r\n  \u001b[92mPS1='$ '      \u001b[0m \u001b[90mchange the prompt (this shell only)\u001b[0m\r\n\r\n", "len": 398}
{"ts": 0.314776, "dir": "out", "enc": "utf8", "data": "\u001b[93m▶ Type \u001b[92mquit\u001b[93m to leave, or \u001b[92mnext\u001b[93m to return to the start of this module.\u001b[0m\r\n\r\n", "len": 103}
{"ts": 0.317372, "dir": "out", "enc": "utf8", "data": "\u001b[1;90mnext\u001b[0m \u001b[90m(start this module again)\u001b[0m   \u001b[1;90mquit\u001b[0m \u001b[90m(leave)\u001b[0m   \u001b[1;90mshow\u001b[0m \u001b[90m(this screen again)\u001b[0m\r\n", "len": 134}
{"ts": 0.31763, "dir": "out", "enc": "utf8", "data": "\u001b[90m────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\u001b[0m\r\n\r\n", "len": 253}
